\[T_{0}(p_{1},p_{2}\,;\alpha)=\int\!d^{4}x_{1}\,d^{4}x_{2}\,e^{- \mathrm{i}p_{1}x_{1}}e^{-\mathrm{i}p_{2}x_{2}}\mathrm{T}(x_{1},x_{2}\,;\alpha)\] \[=\int\!d^{4}X\,d^{4}r\,e^{-\mathrm{i}PX}e^{-\mathrm{i}\tilde{q}r/ 2}\mathrm{T}(X,r\,;\alpha)=\int\!d^{4}re^{-\mathrm{i}\tilde{q}r/2}\tau_{P}(r \,;\alpha) \tag{3.2}\]

